      "vulnerability": {
        "name": "DHI-p3cd-fveh-dqhn-ws3f",
        "aliases": [
          "CVE-2026-59888"
        ]
      },
      "products": [
        {
          "@id": "pkg:apk/dhi/gradle-8@8.14.4-r0?distro=dhi-3.23"
        },
        {
          "@id": "pkg:apk/dhi/gradle-8@8.14.4-r1?distro=dhi-3.23"
        },
        {
          "@id": "pkg:apk/dhi/gradle-8@8.14.4-r2?distro=dhi-3.23"
        },
        {
          "@id": "pkg:apk/dhi/gradle-8@8.14.4-r3?distro=dhi-3.23"
        },
        {
          "@id": "pkg:apk/dhi/gradle-8@8.14.5-r3?distro=dhi-3.23"
        }
      ],
      "status": "affected",
      "action_statement": "Update gradle-8 to 8.14.5-r4 or later.",
      "status_notes": "CVE-2026-59888: for Java records using a PropertyNamingStrategy, jackson-databind checked @JsonIgnore against the pre-rename property name, so an ignored record component could be set through its renamed JSON key. On the 2.18 line jackson-databind 2.15.0 before 2.18.8 is affected and 2.18.8 carries the fix: https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-3pjw-73gf-8qr5 (fix commit https://github.com/FasterXML/jackson-databind/commit/c7c678360624da5bc7eed2152789fa522880db9d, in the jackson-databind-2.18.8 tag). We read the Maven metadata and manifest of every jar, nested jars included, in every published gradle-8 package for Alpine 3.23 in the DHI Alpine repository as listed in its index on 2026-11-28 (16 versions, 8.14.4-r0 to 8.14.8-r0; the aarch64 package of each version has the same index checksum as the x86_64 one, and 8.14.5-r4 is published for x86_64 only). Gradle ships jackson-databind as /usr/share/java/gradle/lib/jackson-databind-<version>.jar, each one byte for byte the Maven Central release of that version, and no other jar in these packages contains jackson-databind classes, relocated or not. Builds 8.14.4-r0 to 8.14.5-r3 ship jackson-databind 2.18.6, 8.14.5-r4 and 8.14.5-r5 ship 2.18.8, 8.14.5-r6 to 8.14.5-r9 ship 2.18.9, 8.14.6-r0 to 8.14.7-r0 ship 2.18.11, and 8.14.8-r0 ships 2.18.12. The range ends at 8.14.5-r4, the first build with jackson-databind 2.18.8 or later."
    },
